{
    "background_story": "Precious was a tortoise who lived in a bustling pet store. While her tankmates were colorful birds, fluffy rabbits, and playful kittens, Precious felt like an outcast. Her shell was dull and weathered, her legs were stumpy, and her face was, well, not exactly what one would call cute. Children would often point and giggle at her, while their parents cooed over the more conventionally attractive animals. But despite her perceived unattractiveness, Precious had a unique charm. She was gentle, wise, and had a deep understanding of the world around her. One day, a shy and awkward boy wandered into the store, and his eyes landed on Precious. He saw beyond her rough exterior and befriended her, discovering that true beauty lies within. As the boy visited Precious every week, the store owner began to notice the special bond between them, and soon, Precious became a beloved fixture in the store, proving that beauty is more than skin-deep.",
